url: https://github.com/EvelynLimaB/Uma-Mod-Manager
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0-alpha.21
date-released: 2026-08-01
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform Umamusume Pretty Derby mod manager and mod-development
  workspace, forked from UMML / UmaMusume Mod Loader. It provides immutable
  package versions, automatic preparation, profiles, compatibility metadata,
  creator workspaces, transactional deployment, recovery, privacy-scrubbed
  tester support bundles, repeatable Community Test releases, resilient mod
  discovery, and credited read-only data integrations with a standalone
  packaged extractor host.
references:
  - type: software
    title: UMML / UmaMusume Mod Loader
    repository-code: https://github.com/tumugu/UmaMusume_Mod_Loader
